  phases start (KET-61). `ai/` is recreated for Phase 4 training (slice D).
  `server/` is the Phase 3 axum crate. `vercel.json`
  at repo root is the frontend deploy config.
- When simplifying after a feature ships, preserve behavior; run lint/build/tests; prefer clarity over line-count.
